### Get all tasks (with filters)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks?status=OPEN&search=Ship&sort=asc
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get my tasks
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/my
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get task by id
GET http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create task
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ship API v1",
  "description": "Finalize auth and task APIs",
  "dueDate": "2026-10-30",
  "status": "OPEN",
  "priority": "HIGH",
  "teamId": 1,
  "assigneeId": 2
}

### Update task
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Ship API v1.1",
  "status": "IN_PROGRESS",
  "priority": "URGENT"
}

### Complete task
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Assign task
PATCH http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1/assign?assigneeId=2
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Delete task
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Add comment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1/comments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "content": "This task is moving to production review."
}

### Upload attachment
POST http://localhost:8080/api/tasks/1/attachments
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample.txt"
Content-Type: text/plain

Hello from Taskmaster
------WebKitFormBoundary--
